# Resched.me API

FastAPI backend for:

- Google Calendar connection and guarded write operations
- LLM planning requests
- Energy-aware scheduling previews
- Voice-to-calendar intent parsing
- Schedule photo import previews

Run locally:

```bash
pip install -e .
uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```
